                                                "sense_id": "d3e59139-365d-33ff-8530-6ec5cb7893c9",
                                                "text": "Three years later, the unwatered cactus was still about two feet tall, a dark green color. The watered cactus was a paler green, its trunk visibly swollen with moisture. It had grown to be over five feet tall."
                                            },
